  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together greek yogurt, garam masala, and cumin seeds.",
    "2. Add the sliced cucumbers and red onions to the bowl and toss to coat with the yogurt mixture.",
    "3. Add the diced tomatoes to the bowl and toss gently to combine.",
    "4. Season with salt to taste.",
    "5. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "6. Just before serving, garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "7. Serve chilled or at room temperature."
